" Tests for the proof text object

Given coq (own-line-i):
  Goal True.
  Proof.
    auto.
    auto.
    auto. auto. auto.
    auto.
  Qed.

Do (own-line-i):
  diP

Expect coq (own-line-i):
  Goal True.
  Proof.
  Qed.

Given coq (own-line-a):
  Goal True.
  Proof.
    auto.
  Qed.

Do (own-line-a):
  daP

Expect coq (own-line-a):
  Goal True.

