" No proof ahead of or around the cursor; start == end == cursor, and
" s:select_a falls through to a linewise selection of the current line.
Given coq (after-last-proof-a):
  Goal True.
  Proof.
    auto.
  Qed.
  Goal False.

Do (after-last-proof-a):
  GdaP

Expect coq (after-last-proof-a):
  Goal True.
  Proof.
    auto.
  Qed.
  Goal False.

